        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "A mid-level contract has been issued. The financial sector of SLICK seems to be rather vulnerable. ICA intel indicates the royal, and SLICK sponsor Amir Sharma is being accompanied by SLICK treasurer Amith Rai, and his two brothers. Eliminate them, and retrieve the tablet they use for financial transactions. These are their identities:\r\r1) Amir Sharma [alias Omar Al-Ghazali]\r2) Amith Rai [alias Akbar Fayad] \r3) Rakesh Rai [alias In&apos;aam Mahdavi]\r4) Kabir Rai [alias Irfaan Zamani]\r\rGood luck.",
